<body>
    <h1>Legacy Compass (R2) Internal User attestation</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <p>There are three time-based internal user attestation happening in Le=
gacy Compass (R2) currently.</p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h3 id=3D"LegacyCompass(R2)InternalUserattestation-Weekly">Weekly</h3>
    <ul>
     <li><span><span>Deactivate inactivity (90-day), orphaned</span></span>=
</li>
    </ul>
    <p><span><span><img height=3D"250" style=3D"margin: 2px; border: 1px so=
lid #ddd; box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: text-bottom;" src=3D"d90f=
eace9997c24df48cb36131ebc79d7a384ced1a05a781bcea7321678ac8cc" width=3D"333"=
></span></span></p>
    <p><br></p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h3 id=3D"LegacyCompass(R2)InternalUserattestation-Quarterly">Quarterly=
</h3>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"f370afd3-6582-4292-8160-467b224e21c2"><span>Audit req=
uirements (since last Dec)</span>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"f012d3c8-13ea-40f1-b06e-1a2d5555c5dd"><span>Documen=
t the quarterly process to govern the high privileged accounts</span></li>
      </ul></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"1bac300b-402d-459a-938b-77b29db7b5fd"><span>Getting m=
anager's signoff on</span><span> high privileged accounts </span>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"4be8a708-71c7-4d19-8b38-b2156924f8af"><span>Input: =
from R2 db (extracts either generated by IT or Katrina)</span>
        <ul>
         <li data-uuid=3D"5e48543e-859b-42da-a84e-2b82391a8a4c"><span>Crite=
ria: SSO role, Super Security Steward role</span></li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"f262b99e-e759-4462-ab2b-23b7f5960caa"><span>Firms=
: NBF, NBT, NBIN, NBIN Operations</span></li>
        </ul></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"4e39787b-c143-487c-a6e3-8373c0b45434"><span> </span=
><span>Merge the list to IIQ report (Compass id, short id, transit #, manag=
er</span><span>, and more</span><span>)</span>
        <ul>
         <li data-uuid=3D"710e1b4b-95a2-4474-9a18-1b67e290af6a"><span>Deliv=
ered by email every Sun</span></li>
        </ul></li>
      </ul></li>
    </ul>
    <p><span><img height=3D"250" style=3D"margin: 2px; border: 1px solid #d=
dd; box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: text-bottom;" src=3D"ebc7853453=
11e593a4cb352fd2b56b421f3c2f0a29b4d4000f209fa782707a10" width=3D"333"></spa=
n></p>
    <p><br></p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h3 id=3D"LegacyCompass(R2)InternalUserattestation-Annually">Annually</=
h3>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"88aac6dc-05fd-44e3-91c3-f4fff9ebc44d"><span>Deactivat=
e</span><span> 90-day inactivity, orphaned</span></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"c9dca102-e8dd-45d5-8255-992b0673d6ed"><span>Compare t=
o Internal Access matrix</span><span> by their transit</span>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"b717ad74-42de-49da-b3d1-3e6aa0928f56"><span>right l=
evel - OK</span></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"672fcb05-24d0-46fc-a01e-845583c4cd4d"><span>under p=
rovisioned - OK</span></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"45587ca7-f43d-4918-ad04-0ba495b94db4"><span>over pr=
ovisioned - check with manager</span>
        <ul>
         <li data-uuid=3D"97ba0b8f-a3bf-4a83-8517-b097ca97e4cf"><span>Appro=
ved </span>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"70c520fd-7a2e-495f-adc1-c353228f6083"><span>App=
rove the Individual: </span><span>re-align to expected access for the perso=
n, </span><span>put it in Exception table</span></li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"1848dd40-d060-45a3-9eda-a30ccec6788a"><span>App=
rove the whole group:</span><span> update internal access matrix (owned by =
Product Support)</span><span> and inform SAA the new version</span></li>
          </ul></li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"82c41901-41f5-476b-b7dc-fdbe059cd31a"><span>Not A=
pproved </span><span>- change it according to the matrix</span></li>
        </ul></li>
      </ul></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"dace0e16-e0be-43ed-852d-320ac82d6138"><span>Proof of =
certification</span>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"28fdc2a3-c396-4f66-8eb2-41d43de61d47"><span>Yearly =
meeting with ID </span><span>custodians</span></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"6bc3ac4d-0b23-4a51-93f5-40d87852293f"><span>Each ap=
p will create their jira tickets</span>
        <ul>
         <li data-uuid=3D"8a68e04f-5389-466e-be6b-e4753932af04"><span>At th=
e end, attach the spreadsheet generated for the certification</span></li>
        </ul></li>
      </ul></li>
    </ul>
    <p><br></p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h3 id=3D"LegacyCompass(R2)InternalUserattestation-PainPoints">Pain Poi=
nts</h3>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"a7420348-d05f-4077-9cc3-46d1380e4869">Disconnected sy=
stems=20
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"5c3e9b40-7319-483e-94c1-19bc9239c815">Background: T=
he annual user attestation requires that user permission be examined; Actua=
l permissions vs. matrix defined permission. The data needed for this exerc=
ise are taken from 3 separate sources.=20
        <ul>
         <li data-uuid=3D"199e66c5-6215-48ab-851a-88ddef38f52a">Compass Leg=
acy database =E2=80=93 the source for actual user permissions.</li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"a634c485-722f-4922-b06d-281418992f4a">User Access=
 Matrix =E2=80=93 the source for the profiles, its defined permissions, and=
 transits permitted to access Compass Legacy.</li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"75180563-30a3-4e3f-a943-b92dc7e8b3ab">Compass Leg=
acy IIQ Report =E2=80=93 the source users and their corresponding transit n=
umbers and manager information.</li>
        </ul></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"b5e8ba3a-fd24-48a2-b373-17184bad4739">Feedback: Com=
paring these sets of data is time consuming with the number of users we hav=
e on Compass Legacy. There are 1498 active internal user IDs in Compass Leg=
acy. I complete this exercise on excel using formulas to compare sets of da=
ta.</li>
      </ul></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"7c02ea69-83d5-4c58-9db0-4c397113b4bc">Data Maintenanc=
e=20
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"9112d1aa-3442-4a27-86d8-ff6b6cb60fd2">Background: T=
he User Access Matrix contains a list of transit number, the profile each t=
ransit is permitted to have, and that transit=E2=80=99s access guardians. G=
uardians must approve of access requests on My IT.</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"8cdda528-7f5e-43d3-9dcb-71b856c63118">Feedback:=20
        <ul>
         <li data-uuid=3D"2b0ece36-2f54-4fe6-98bb-38a8b7fb47c3">New transit=
s can be created without notice and these transits do not have a defined pr=
ofile.</li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"2b689768-04f2-4a8f-b860-dcdd1795fb99">Existing gu=
ardians can leave or change roles and leave a team or transit without a My =
IT approver.</li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"5b7e8c92-c05f-4071-a463-d02d4f0ab048">Users can l=
eave a team, and their access is not realigned to their role unless their m=
anager submits a request, or until the annual user attestation exercise ide=
ntifies and corrects the issue.</li>
        </ul></li>
      </ul></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"9965cb47-ee67-48d9-bb6d-7e8d60713908">Manager attesta=
tions=20
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"5b1792ef-3566-4cdc-a6e8-a80798de4c98">Feedback: Alt=
hough the Compass team generates the file, and ultimately provides user att=
estation for Compass Legacy =E2=80=93 individual attestations are requested=
 from the managers of the users:=20
        <ul>
         <li data-uuid=3D"f06ca170-cd4d-41ed-b273-b2d99de6b432">Whose actua=
l access divert from the defined permissions;</li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"f7ac36cb-36a6-4811-a8b5-1c4454a5e693">Whose trans=
it numbers do not exist within the access matrix;</li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"bc1a96c2-a08a-4798-a6d2-a8c7aa7eceed">Whose acces=
s is an exception case</li>
        </ul></li>
      </ul></li>
    </ul>
    <p><br></p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
